{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "God’s Promise Is Not Slack"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, I now write to you this second epistle (in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "both of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " which I stir up your pure minds by way of reminder), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that you may be mindful of the words which were spoken before by the holy prophets, and of the commandment of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M the apostles of your Lord and Savior or your apostles of the Lord and Savior"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "us, the apostles of the Lord and Savior, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "knowing this first: that scoffers will come in the last days, walking according to their own lusts, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and saying, “Where is the promise of His coming? For since the fathers fell asleep, all things continue as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from the beginning of creation.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this they willfully forget: that by the word of God the heavens were of old, and the earth standing out of water and in the water, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by which the world "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " then existed perished, being flooded with water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the heavens and the earth "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " are now preserved by the same word, are reserved for fire until the day of judgment and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "destruction"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perdition of ungodly men."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But, beloved, do not forget this one thing, that with the Lord one day "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as a thousand years, and a thousand years as one day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The Lord is not slack concerning "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " promise, as some count slackness, but is longsuffering toward "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "us, not willing that any should perish but that all should come to repentance."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Day of the Lord"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the day of the Lord will come as a thief in the night, in which the heavens will pass away with a great noise, and the elements will melt with fervent heat; both the earth and the works that are in it will be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU laid bare, lit. found"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "burned up. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, since all these things will be dissolved, what manner "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of persons"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ought you to be in holy conduct and godliness, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "looking for and hastening the coming of the day of God, because of which the heavens will be dissolved, being on fire, and the elements will melt with fervent heat? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless we, according to His promise, look for new heavens and a new earth in which righteousness dwells."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Be Steadfast"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, beloved, looking forward to these things, be diligent to be found by Him in peace, without spot and blameless; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and consider "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the longsuffering of our Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " salvation—as also our beloved brother Paul, according to the wisdom given to him, has written to you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as also in all his epistles, speaking in them of these things, in which are some things hard to understand, which untaught and unstable "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "people"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " twist to their own destruction, as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also the rest of the Scriptures."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You therefore, beloved, since you know "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beforehand, beware lest you also fall from your own steadfastness, being led away with the error of the wicked; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but grow in the grace and knowledge of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To Him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the glory both now and forever. Amen."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}